+## Monitor API Pricing
+
+| Monitor type | Price | Price per 1,000 units |
+|---|---|---|
+| Search | $0.001 per succeeded Search run | $1 per 1,000 runs |
+| Page | $0.001 per counted fetched URL in a succeeded Page run | $1 per 1,000 counted URLs |
+
+Cost = (succeeded Search runs + counted fetched URLs from succeeded Page runs) × $0.001. Failed and skipped runs are free. A succeeded Search run is billed once, even if it performs multiple searches or returns no findings. In the calculator, choose Monitor API and enter both totals for the same period. The run's `usage.cost` reports list-price cost, not the invoice or amount charged.
+
+### Rate limits
+
+See Monitor API limits for HTTP request limits by usage tier.
